  "title": "Session is expired warning",
  "content": "<p>I have suggestion. For example I can write post whole day. After about 10 hours while adding image/attachment I get strange msg “Yocto 5.0.webp: Something went wrong, please check your link and try again.” (where Yocto 5.0.webp is a name of my attachment) Perhaps this msg should be fixed to something like “Yocto 5.0.webp: Something went wrong, perhaps your session is expired. You should manually save all your progress and reload the page”</p>",
